//　そして獅子吼をも失えば、六波羅はもはや
//崩壊を避けられません」
"The other three Kanto generals have vanished, likely together with Fudaraku. Shishiku's death will render Rokuhara's collapse inevitable."

pt:
//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/mc03/0080590a03'>
