"They won't have cause."

pt:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/mc03/0080650a00'>
//「攻める意味がない……」
“Eles não terão motivo.”

en:
//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/mc03/0080660a03'>
